{"asset_key":"ep1/quest_story_11111300","episode":"ep1","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11111300","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:3:1111130001:1":{"text":"마스터, 여기 보물 지도가 있어요!","source_cn":"主人，满满发现了一张藏宝图！！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x2563F41860903973","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"마스터, 여기 보물 지도가 있어요!","female":"마스터, 여기 보물 지도가 있어요!","variant_male_record_index":"121920","variant_female_record_index":"121921","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"picture:4::1":{"text":"보물지도 한 장","source_cn":"一张藏宝图","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDE32D4C0A30C869F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1111130002:2":{"text":"보물 지도? 트라이브의 보물 지도는 나도 처음 보는군.","source_cn":"藏宝图？蛮血的藏宝图我倒是第一次见。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7FA6CFF4B20F630F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1111130003:0":{"text":"지도에 3곳이 표시되어 있어. 크림슨 고원에 숨겨진 보물을 나타내는 지도인가?","source_cn":"标记了三处地点。这是深红高原宝藏的分布图？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x15841C9FBF07A6F5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1111130004:1":{"text":"현상금, 보물찾기와 관련된 정보는 정확하지 않을 때가 많지.","source_cn":"悬赏、寻宝，拿到的情报常常不准。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x22BE7E1B4819B3E7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1111130005:1":{"text":"내 경험상 가운데 있는 표식이 조금 다른 걸 보니, 사막의 발톱 놈들은 여기에 진짜 보물이 숨겨져 있다고 생각하는 것 같군... 나머지 두 곳은 그냥 속임수일 뿐이야.","source_cn":"从我的经验看，中间那个显眼的标记与众不同，也许流沙之爪...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9CA9C9653C6B812F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1111130006:1":{"text":"이게 진짜 보물 지도라면 아주 중요한 정보야. 다른 사람에게 들켜선 안 되니, 지키는 놈들이 있는 것도 당연한 거고.","source_cn":"如果是藏宝图，那的确是非常重要的情报，不能随便被人得知...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x06A1BF44163A2ED0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1111130007:1":{"text":"보물을 찾으려고 사람들을 약탈해서 보물찾기 도구를 빼앗은 건가?","source_cn":"为了挖掘宝藏，就到处劫人，抢夺挖掘工具？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3FDA067EE90ECED3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1111130008:1":{"text":"한심하고 지루해.","source_cn":"可悲，无聊。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDEE8E23A70F4376A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:满满":{"text":"치피","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:瓦尔克":{"text":"워커","source":"瓦尔克","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:索恩":{"text":"소렌","source":"索恩","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":10,"localized_text_count":9,"speaker_count":3